    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n91058" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτότοκ-ος</span></b>  (parox.), 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾱτοτόκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bearing</i> or <i>having borne her first-born</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήτηρ π</span>., of a heifer, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				17.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἴξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					5.27
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὗς, ταὧς</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				546a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				564a30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					2.70.6
				</span></i>
			; of women, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				151c
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				161a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύμφη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>L.</u>
					193
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> proparox.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρωτότοκος, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span></span>, 
				Pass.
			,<i>first-born</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ge.</u>
				22.21
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
