				Man.
				3.9
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π. τῶν προβάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Ge.</u>
					4.4
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i>PMag. Osl.</i><i><span class="en">
				1.312
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. ἐγὼ ἢ σύ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>2 Ki.</u>
					19.43
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πάσης κτίσεως</span>”
